    <string name="rear_led_setup_title">Set up rear RGB LEDs</string>
    <string name="rear_led_setup_message">Google doesn\'t let regular apps control the Pixel 11 Pro\'s RGB light ring. It works through Shizuku, a free app that shares ADB permissions with apps you approve.\n\n1. Install Shizuku.\n2. Open Shizuku and start it with Wireless debugging (follow its guide). You\'ll need to do this again after each reboot.\n3. Come back here, turn on Rear RGB LEDs, and tap Allow.\n\nThe white flashlight itself can\'t change color. The colors come from the small LED ring around it, so expect a colored glow rather than flashlight brightness.</string>
